# Title: Suspicious Child Process of AspNetCompiler
# ID: 9ccba514-7cb6-4c5c-b377-700758f2f120
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2023-08-14
# Tags: attack.execution, attack.stealth, attack.t1127
# Description: Detects potentially suspicious child processes of "aspnet_compiler.exe".
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((process_name:*\\calc.exe OR process_name:*\\notepad.exe)) OR ((process_name:*\\Users\\Public\\* OR process_name:*\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\* OR process_name:*\\AppData\\Local\\Roaming\\* OR process_name:*:\\Temp\\* OR process_name:*:\\Windows\\Temp\\* OR process_name:*:\\Windows\\System32\\Tasks\\* OR process_name:*:\\Windows\\Tasks\\*))) AND (parent_name:*\\aspnet_compiler.exe))
